@startuml cgms_safety_flow
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title Safety-Critical Flow (IEC 62304 – Updated)

component "Glucose Sensor" as Sensor
component "MCU / Firmware" as MCU
component "Power Manager" as Power
component "Lifecycle Manager" as Life
component "Signal Validation" as Validate
component "Diagnostics Manager" as Diag
component "Alert Manager" as Alert
component User

' --------------------
' Measurement gating
' --------------------
Power --> MCU : power OK?
Life --> MCU : measurement allowed?

' --------------------
' Measurement & processing
' --------------------
Sensor --> MCU : raw sensor sample
MCU --> Validate : conditioned signal

' --------------------
' Safety validation
' --------------------
Validate --> Diag : quality metrics
Diag --> Validate : fault / OK

' --------------------
' Decision & alerting
' --------------------
Validate --> Alert : validated glucose + trend
Diag --> Alert : fault state (override)

Alert --> User : glucose alarm / fault alert

note right of Validate
Safety Controls:
- Range checks
- Rate-of-change limits
- Quality / validity gating
- Expiration enforcement
end note

note right of Diag
Diagnostics:
- Sensor degradation
- Power anomalies
- Signal integrity
end note

note right of Alert
Software Safety Class: C
Fail-safe behavior:
- Fault overrides glucose
- No alarm on invalid data
end note

@enduml
